<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Notice of Action Taken</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 11px; margin: 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 16px; } h2 { font-size: 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; }
</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Notice of Action Taken</h1>
<p>{{lenderName}} — {{noticeDate}}</p>
<p>Applicant: {{applicantName}}<br>
Application: {{applicationId}}</p>
<p>Thank you for your application. After careful review, we are unable
to extend credit on the terms requested. The principal reason(s) for
this decision:</p>
<ul>{{#each reasons}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
<p>You have the right under the Equal Credit Opportunity Act to obtain,
within 60 days, a written statement of the specific reasons for this
action.</p>
</body></html>
